e ter escrito o e-mail com pressa","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nina escreve: “I regret writing it in such a hurry”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l03-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u1-apology","document":"email","setting":"Um e-mail que tenta esclarecer um mal-entendido.","from":"Nina","to":"Mark","title":"About my email","lines":["Hi Mark,","I want to apologize for my email yesterday. I realize it sounded rude, and I regret writing it in such a hurry.","I did not mean to criticize your work. Actually, the report is very good. I only wanted to show you one mistake in the numbers before the meeting.","Next time I will stop to think before I click \"send\". If you have a minute today, I would be happy to talk about it.","Best wishes,","Nina"]},"question":"O que a Nina vai fazer da próxima vez?","options":["Parar para pensar antes de clicar em “enviar”","Parar de mandar e-mails","Pedir para o Mark revisar os e-mails dela","Escrever mais rápido"]},"answer":"Parar para pensar antes de clicar em “enviar”","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Nina escreve: “Next time I will stop to think before I click \"send\"” (stop + to = parar para).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l03-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I regret saying those things to my brother.","options":["I regret saying those things to my brother.","I regret saying those things to my mother.","I don't regret saying those things to my brother.","I regret not saying those things to my brother."]},"answer":"I regret saying those things to my brother.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-regret"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l03-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l03","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Remember","to","call","your","grandmother","tonight"],"translation":"Lembre de ligar para a sua avó hoje à noite."},"answer":"Remember to call your grandmother tonight.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-remember-doing"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l03-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l03","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Are you still smoking? (você parou de fumar há dois anos)","translation":"Você fuma?"},"answer":"No, I stopped smoking two years ago.","accepted_answers":["I stopped smoking two years ago.","No, I stopped two years ago.","No. I stopped smoking two years ago."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-remember-doing"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l03-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l03","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Eu me lembro de ter conhecido ela, mas esqueci de perguntar o nome dela."},"answer":"I remember meeting her, but I forgot to ask her name.","accepted_answers":["I remember meeting her but I forgot to ask her name.","I remember meeting her, but I forgot to ask her what her name was."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-remember-doing"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l04-e01","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l04","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Una cada palavra ao seu significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"straightforward","right":"direto / franco"},{"left":"blunt","right":"grosseiro / direto demais"},{"left":"tactful","right":"com tato 