tting":"Um post de blog sobre como dar uma opinião difícil.","title":"How to say difficult things","lines":["Most of us tend to avoid difficult conversations. We are afraid of hurting people, so we say nothing, or we drop a hint and hope the other person understands.","The problem is that hints are easy to miss. Your colleague may not realize there is a problem at all.","Being straightforward does not mean being blunt. Start with something positive, then point out the problem clearly and calmly, and finally look for a solution together.","Remember: people can accept honest feedback when it is tactful. What they find hard to accept is sarcasm."]},"question":"Segundo o texto, qual é o problema das indiretas?","options":["Que é fácil não perceber","Que são grosseiras","Que levam muito tempo","Que sempre ofendem"]},"answer":"Que é fácil não perceber","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O texto diz: “The problem is that hints are easy to miss”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l04-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u1-feedback-post","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como dar uma opinião difícil.","title":"How to say difficult things","lines":["Most of us tend to avoid difficult conversations. We are afraid of hurting people, so we say nothing, or we drop a hint and hope the other person understands.","The problem is that hints are easy to miss. Your colleague may not realize there is a problem at all.","Being straightforward does not mean being blunt. Start with something positive, then point out the problem clearly and calmly, and finally look for a solution together.","Remember: people can accept honest feedback when it is tactful. What they find hard to accept is sarcasm."]},"question":"Que diferença o texto faz entre straightforward e blunt?","options":["Dá para ser claro sem ser grosseiro","São a mesma coisa","Ser grosseiro funciona melhor","É preciso evitar ser claro"]},"answer":"Dá para ser claro sem ser grosseiro","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O texto diz: “Being straightforward does not mean being blunt”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l04-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l04","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u1-feedback-post","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como dar uma opinião difícil.","title":"How to say difficult things","lines":["Most of us tend to avoid difficult conversations. We are afraid of hurting people, so we say nothing, or we drop a hint and hope the other person understands.","The problem is that hints are easy to miss. Your colleague may not realize there is a problem at all.","Being straightforward does not mean being blunt. Start with something positive, then point out the problem clearly and calmly, and finally look for a solution together.","Remember: people can accept honest feedback when it is tactful. What they find hard to accept is sarcasm."]},"question":"Segundo o texto, o que as pessoas aceitam pior?","options":["O sarcasmo","Uma opinião sincera","Um comentário positivo","Uma solução em conjunto"]},"answer":"O sarcasmo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O texto diz: “people can accept honest feedback when it is tactful. What they find hard to accept is sarcasm”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u01-l04-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u01-l04","position":8,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Don't bring up politics at dinner.","options":["Don't bring up politics at dinner.","Don't bring up politics at work.","Do bring up politics at dinner.","Don't t