:"reached","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Collocation: reach an agreement (chegar a um acordo).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-reach-an-agreement"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u02-l01-e03","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u02-l01","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If you agree, we have a ___.","translation":"Se você concorda, negócio fechado.","options":["deal","proposal","price","meeting"]},"answer":"deal","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-deal"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u02-l01-e04","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u02-l01","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u2-supplier","setting":"Uma gerente negocia com um fornecedor o preço e a data de entrega.","speakers":[{"name":"Rachel","voice":"a"},{"name":"Daniel","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Thanks for the proposal, Daniel. To be honest, the price is higher than we expected."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"I understand. What if we kept the price but delivered two weeks earlier?"},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Time is not our main priority. The budget is. Could you go down five percent?"},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"Five is difficult. I could offer three, as long as you sign a two-year contract."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Two years is a long time. Let's meet halfway: four percent and an eighteen-month contract."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"That sounds fair. Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Great. Please send me the new terms in writing."}]},"question":"O que preocupa a Rachel na proposta?","options":["O preço, mais alto do que eles esperavam","A data de entrega","A qualidade do produto","A duração do contrato"]},"answer":"O preço, mais alto do que eles esperavam","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Rachel diz: “the price is higher than we expected” e “Time is not our main priority. The budget is”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u02-l01-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u02-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u2-supplier","setting":"Uma gerente negocia com um fornecedor o preço e a data de entrega.","speakers":[{"name":"Rachel","voice":"a"},{"name":"Daniel","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Thanks for the proposal, Daniel. To be honest, the price is higher than we expected."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"I understand. What if we kept the price but delivered two weeks earlier?"},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Time is not our main priority. The budget is. Could you go down five percent?"},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"Five is difficult. I could offer three, as long as you sign a two-year contract."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Two years is a long time. Let's meet halfway: four percent and an eighteen-month contract."},{"speaker":"Daniel","text":"That sounds fair. Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal."},{"speaker":"Rachel","text":"Great. Please send me the new terms in writing."}]},"question":"Como termina a negociação?","options":["Com um acordo, contanto que o diretor do Daniel concorde","Sem acordo","Com um acordo assinado no mesmo dia","Com uma nova reunião"]},"answer":"Com um acordo, contanto que o diretor do Daniel concorde","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Daniel diz: “Provided that my director agrees, we have a deal”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u02-l01-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u02-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We need to negotiate a better price.","options":["We n