gain"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l02-e04","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l02","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u5-savings","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como economizar.","title":"How I saved $3,000 in a year","lines":["Last January I looked at my bank account and realized I had no savings at all. So I decided to change a few things.","First, I cut back on subscriptions. I was paying for four streaming services and a gym I never went to. Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month.","Second, I started buying second-hand clothes and furniture. Most of it is in perfect condition and costs half the price.","Third, before buying anything, I ask myself one question: is this good value for money, or do I just want it?","One year later, I have saved three thousand dollars. It was by far the best decision I made last year."]},"question":"O que a autora fez primeiro para economizar?","options":["Cancelou assinaturas que não usava","Fez um empréstimo","Mudou de emprego","Vendeu o carro"]},"answer":"Cancelou assinaturas que não usava","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ela escreve: “First, I cut back on subscriptions… Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l02-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u5-savings","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como economizar.","title":"How I saved $3,000 in a year","lines":["Last January I looked at my bank account and realized I had no savings at all. So I decided to change a few things.","First, I cut back on subscriptions. I was paying for four streaming services and a gym I never went to. Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month.","Se