: “Most of it is in perfect condition and costs half the price”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l02-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I canceled two subscriptions last month.","options":["I canceled two subscriptions last month.","I canceled three subscriptions last month.","I started two subscriptions last month.","I canceled two subscriptions this month."]},"answer":"I canceled two subscriptions last month.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-subscription"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l02-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","bought","a","second-hand","bike","for","fifty","dollars"],"translation":"Comprei uma bicicleta usada por cinquenta dólares."},"answer":"I bought a second-hand bike for fifty dollars.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-second-hand"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l02-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l02","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"How do you save money? (você gasta menos com roupa)","translation":"Como você economiza?"},"answer":"I cut back on clothes.","accepted_answers":["I cut back on buying clothes.","I'm cutting back on clothes.","I spend less on clothes."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-cut-back-on"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l02-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l02","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Trinta dólares? É uma verdadeira pechincha!"},"answer":"Thirty dol