e":"Customer","voice":"a"},{"name":"Assistant","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Hi. I dropped my phone yesterday and I'd like to have the screen replaced."},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Let me see. Yes, we can do that. It's ninety dollars, and it'll be ready tomorrow."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Ninety? That's twice as much as I paid last time!"},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Last time you had a cheaper screen put in. This one is original. The cheaper ones are nowhere near as good."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"Hmm. Is it worth it? The phone is three years old."},{"speaker":"Assistant","text":"Honestly, the older the phone, the less sense it makes. A new one costs about four hundred."},{"speaker":"Customer","text":"I can't afford a new one right now. Go ahead and replace the screen, please."}]},"question":"Por que desta vez a tela custa o dobro?","options":["Porque é original; da última vez colocaram uma mais barata","Porque o celular é novo","Porque a entrega é hoje","Porque os preços subiram"]},"answer":"Porque é original; da última vez colocaram uma mais barata","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O atendente diz: “Last time you had a cheaper screen put in. This one is original. The cheaper ones are nowhere near as good”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l04-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u5-savings","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como economizar.","title":"How I saved $3,000 in a year","lines":["Last January I looked at my bank account and realized I had no savings at all. So I decided to change a few things.","First, I cut back on subscriptions. I was paying for four streaming services and a gym I never went to. Canceling them saved me sixty dollars a month.","Second, I started buying second-hand clothes and furniture. Most of it is in perfect condition and costs half the price.","Third, before buying anything, I ask myself one question: is this good value for money, or do I just want it?","One year later, I have saved three thousand dollars. It was by far the best decision I made last year."]},"question":"Como a autora avalia a decisão de economizar?","options":["Como de longe a melhor decisão do ano passado","Como um erro","Como algo difícil que não repetiria","Como uma decisão qualquer"]},"answer":"Como de longe a melhor decisão do ano passado","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ela escreve: “It was by far the best decision I made last year”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l04-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l04","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The cheap ones are nowhere near as good.","options":["The cheap ones are nowhere near as good.","The cheap ones are just as good.","The cheap ones are nowhere near as bad.","The new ones are nowhere near as good."]},"answer":"The cheap ones are nowhere near as good.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-nowhere-near"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l04-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l04","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["This","restaurant","is","great","value","for","money"],"translation":"Este restaurante tem um ótimo custo-benefício."},"answer":"This restaurant is great value for money.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-value-for-money"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u05-l04-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u05-l04","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Is your new f