va","text":"Honestly, you shouldn't have joked about that. She's very nervous about it."},{"speaker":"Max","text":"You're right. I should have thought before I spoke. I'll call her tonight and apologize."}]},"question":"O que Max lamenta e o que ele vai fazer?","options":["Não ter pensado antes de falar; vai ligar para ela para pedir desculpas","Ter ligado tarde; vai mandar uma mensagem","Ter perdido o celular; vai comprar outro","Nada; vai esperar"]},"answer":"Não ter pensado antes de falar; vai ligar para ela para pedir desculpas","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Max diz: “I should have thought before I spoke. I’ll call her tonight and apologize”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u06-l02-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u06-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"You could have told me earlier!","options":["You could have told me earlier!","You should have told me earlier!","You could have told me later!","You could have called me earlier!"]},"answer":"You could have told me earlier!","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-could-have"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u06-l02-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u06-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["I","should","have","called","you","yesterday"],"translation":"Eu deveria ter te ligado ontem."},"answer":"I should have called you yesterday.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-should-have"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u06-l02-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u06-l02","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why do you feel bad? (você deveria ter estudado mais)","translation":"Por que você está se se