r":"Zoe","text":"Have you seen this? A post says that drinking hot water every hour stops you from getting a cold."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"I've seen it. It went viral yesterday. My aunt has already shared it with the whole family."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Is it true, though? The post claims that doctors recommend it."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Which doctors? It doesn’t say. That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"So it’s just a rumor?"},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Probably. A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"I'll send the link to your aunt, then. Before she shares the next one!"}]},"question":"O que o post viral diz?","options":["Que tomar água quente toda hora evita resfriados","Que água fria cura resfriado","Que os médicos são contra a água","Que é preciso tomar remédio toda hora"]},"answer":"Que tomar água quente toda hora evita resfriados","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Zoe diz: “A post says that drinking hot water every hour stops you from getting a cold”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l01-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-viral","setting":"Duas amigas falam de um post que viralizou.","speakers":[{"name":"Zoe","voice":"a"},{"name":"Amy","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Have you seen this? A post says that drinking hot water every hour stops you from getting a cold."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"I've seen it. It went viral yesterday. My aunt has already shared it with the whole family."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Is it true, though? The post claims that doctors recommend it."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Which doctors? It doesn’t say. That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"So it’s just a rumor?"},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Probably. A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"I'll send the link to your aunt, then. Before she shares the next one!"}]},"question":"Segundo a Amy, como a desinformação se espalha?","options":["Sem nomes nem fontes, só com uma grande promessa","Pelos jornais","Por meio dos médicos","Com muitos dados"]},"answer":"Sem nomes nem fontes, só com uma grande promessa","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Amy diz: “That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l01-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l01","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-viral","setting":"Duas amigas falam de um post que viralizou.","speakers":[{"name":"Zoe","voice":"a"},{"name":"Amy","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Have you seen this? A post says that drinking hot water every hour stops you from getting a cold."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"I've seen it. It went viral yesterday. My aunt has already shared it with the whole family."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Is it true, though? The post claims that doctors recommend it."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Which doctors? It doesn’t say. That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"So it’s just a rumor?"},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Probably. A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"I'll send the link to your aunt, then. Before she shares the next one!"}]},"question":"O que o site de checagem encontrou?","options":["Nenhuma prova de que seja verdade","Que é verdade","Que quem disse foi um médico famoso","Que o post foi apagado"]},"answer":"Nenhuma prova de que seja verdade","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Amy diz: “A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l01-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l01","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"It's just a rumor. Don't believe it.","options":["It's just a rumor. Don't believe it.","It's just a rumor. Believe it.","It's not a rumor. Don't believe it.","It's just a story. Don't believe it."]},"answer":"It's just a rumor. Don't believe it.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-rumor"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l01-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l01","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["There","is","a","lot","of","misinformation","online"],"translation":"Há muita desinformação na internet."},"answer":"There is a lot of misinformation online.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-misinformation"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l01-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l01","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why is everyone talking about that video? (porque viralizou)","translation":"Por que todo mundo está falando desse vídeo?"},"answer":"Because it went viral.","accepted_answers":["It went viral.","Because it has gone viral.","Because it's gone viral."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-go-viral"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l01-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l01","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","sourc