prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"She insisted ___ paying for dinner.","translation":"Ela insistiu em pagar o jantar.","options":["on","in","to","for"]},"answer":"on","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-insist"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l02-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Uma notícia de um jornal local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"O que o post nas redes sociais tinha sugerido?","options":["Que já estava decidido fechar o parque para construir escritórios","Que o parque ia ficar maior","Que a prefeita ia renunciar","Que os escritórios iam fechar"]},"answer":"Que já estava decidido fechar o parque para construir escritórios","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A notícia diz: “A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l02-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Uma notícia de um jornal local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"Sobre o que a prefeita alertou e o que ela sugeriu?","options":["Que não acreditem em tudo o que leem na internet e que consultem o site da cidade","Que não vão ao parque","Que apaguem o post","Que liguem para a prefeitura"]},"answer":"Que não acreditem em tudo o que leem na internet e que consultem o site da cidade","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A notícia diz: “She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l02-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"He warned me not to touch the cables.","options":["He warned me not to touch the cables.","He told me to touch the cables.","He warned me not to cut the cables.","She warned me not to touch the cables."]},"answer":"He warned me not to touch the cables.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-warn"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l02-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l02","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":