"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Uma notícia de um jornal local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"O que a prefeita admitiu?","options":["Que a cidade tinha discutido escritórios novos na região","Que iam fechar o parque","Que o post era verdadeiro","Que não conhecia o plano"]},"answer":"Que a cidade tinha discutido escritórios novos na região","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A notícia diz: “She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l05-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Uma notícia de um jornal local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"O que fez a pessoa que criou o post?","options":["Recusou-se a comentar","Pediu desculpas","Apagou o post","Falou com a prefeita"]},"answer":"Recusou-se a comentar","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A notícia termina assim: “The person who created the post has refused to comment”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l05-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u8-interview","setting":"Uma entrevista na televisão com um político.","speakers":[{"name":"Journalist","voice":"a"},{"name":"Hart","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Mr. Hart, a newspaper has accused your party of using public money for its campaign. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I completely deny that. Every dollar we spent was ours."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"But you admitted last week that the campaign had used government offices."},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I admitted using one office for one meeting. That's very different."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Will you publish the campaign accounts?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I refuse to answer questions based on rumors. I insist that we haven't done anything wrong."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe."}]},"question":"O que a jornalista sugere com o último comentário?","options":["Que muita gente não vai acreditar no Hart","Que Hart tem razão","Que a entrevista terminou bem","Que o público não estava assistindo"]},"answer":"Que muita gente não vai acreditar no Hart","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A jornalista diz: “Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l05-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The program has a large audience.","options":["The program has a large audience.","The program has a small audience.","The program had a large audience.","The concert has a large audience."]},"answer":"The program has a large audience.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-audience"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l05-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["She","suggested","checking","the","official","website"],"translation":"Ela sugeriu consultar o site oficial."},"answer":"She suggested checking the official website.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-suggest"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l05-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l05","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"What did the post claim? (que o parque ia ser fechado)","translation":"O que o post afirmava?"},"answer":"It claimed that the park was going to close.","accepted_answers":["It claimed that the park would close.","It claimed that the park would be closed.","It claimed the park was going to close."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-claim"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u08-l05-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u08-l05","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"trans