ficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-would-have"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-rev1-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-rev1","position":10,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I had studied, I would have ___ the exam.","translation":"Se eu tivesse estudado, teria passado na prova.","options":["passed","pass","passing","to pass"]},"answer":"passed","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Would have + particípio (passed).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-would-have"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e01","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Una cada palavra ao seu significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"mindset","right":"mentalidade / forma de pensar"},{"left":"potential","right":"potencial"},{"left":"motivation","right":"motivação"},{"left":"make progress","right":"progredir / avançar"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-mindset","ept-potential","ept-motivation","ept-make-progress"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e02","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"You are ___ great progress with your English.","translation":"Você está progredindo muito no seu inglês.","options":["making","doing","having","taking"]},"answer":"making","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Collocation: make progress (não “do progress”).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-make-progress"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e03","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Good teachers help students reach their ___.","translation":"Os bons professores ajudam os alunos a desenvolver o seu potencial.","options":["potential","mindset","motivation","talent"]},"answer":"potential","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-potential"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e04","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo de divulgação sobre a mentalidade de crescimento.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"O que pensam as pessoas com “mentalidade fixa” quando têm dificuldade com algo?","options":["Que simplesmente não são boas nisso","Que precisam praticar mais","Que o professor é ruim","Que é questão de tempo"]},"answer":"Que simplesmente não são boas nisso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo de divulgação sobre a mentalidade de crescimento.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"Para quem tem “mentalidade de crescimento”, o que é um erro?","options":["Uma informação que mostra o que praticar depois","Um fracasso","Um motivo para desistir","Algo que é preciso esconder"]},"answer":"Uma informação que mostra o que praticar depois","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-mindset","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo de divulgação sobre a mentalidade de crescimento.","title":"It is not about talent","lines":["Why do some students give up after one bad grade, while others work harder? According to many psychologists, the answer is their mindset.","People with a \"fixed mindset\" believe that intelligence is something you are born with. When they struggle, they think: \"I am just not good at this.\"","People with a \"growth mindset\" believe that ability can be developed. For them, a mistake is not a failure but information: it shows what to practice next.","The good news is that mindset can change. Teachers who praise effort instead of talent help students reach their potential, and students who see their progress stay motivated for longer."]},"question":"O que ajuda os alunos a continuarem motivados por mais tempo?","options":["Ver o próprio progresso","Tirar notas boas","Ter talento","Estudar sozinhos"]},"answer":"Ver o próprio progresso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “students who see their progress stay motivated for longer”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Motivation comes and goes.","options":["Motivation comes and goes.","Motivation comes and stays.","Motivation goes and comes back.","Money comes and goes."]},"answer":"Motivation comes and goes.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-motivation"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Your","mindset","is","more","important","than","your","talent"],"translation":"A sua forma de pensar é mais importante que o seu talento."},"answer":"Your mindset is more important than your talent.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-mindset"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"How is your English going? (você está progredindo muito)","translation":"Como está indo o seu inglês?"},"answer":"I am making great progress.","accepted_answers":["I'm making great progress.","I'm making a lot of progress.","I am making good progress."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-make-progress"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l03-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l03","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"A motivação vem e vai."},"answer":"Motivation comes and goes.","accepted_answers":["Motivation comes and goes!"],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-motivation"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e01","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Una cada palavra ao seu significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"procrastinate","right":"procrastinar / deixar para depois"},{"left":"self-discipline","right":"autodisciplina / constância"},{"left":"keep track of","right":"acompanhar / registrar"},{"left":"catch up","right":"pôr em dia"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-procrastinate","ept-self-discipline","ept-keep-track-of","ept-catch-up"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e02","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I keep ___ of my study hours in a notebook.","translation":"Eu registro as minhas horas de estudo num caderno.","options":["track","list","time","care"]},"answer":"track","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-keep-track-of"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e03","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I missed two classes, so I need to catch ___.","translation":"Faltei a duas aulas, então preciso pôr a matéria em dia.","options":["up","on","out","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-catch-up"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e04","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre parar de procrastinar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"Segundo o autor, o que o ajudou a parar de procrastinar?","options":["A autodisciplina: uma rotina que funciona até nos dias ruins","A motivação","Um professor particular","Desligar o celular"]},"answer":"A autodisciplina: uma rotina que funciona até nos dias ruins","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ele escreve: “What finally helped was not motivation… What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre parar de procrastinar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"O que ele faz com cada sessão de estudo?","options":["Anota num caderno e gosta de ver a lista crescer","Grava em vídeo","Compartilha nas redes sociais","Mostra para um amigo"]},"answer":"Anota num caderno e gosta de ver a lista crescer","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ele escreve: “I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Um estudante conversa com uma orientadora da universidade.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"Por que Ivan está pensando em largar a faculdade?","options":["Faltou seis semanas por causa do trabalho e acha que não vai conseguir pôr a matéria em dia","Não gosta do curso","Ofereceram a ele um emprego melhor","Foi reprovado numa prova"]},"answer":"Faltou seis semanas por causa do trabalho e acha que não vai conseguir pôr a matéria em dia","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivan diz: “I’ve missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I’ll never catch up”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Learning a language takes self-discipline.","options":["Learning a language takes self-discipline.","Learning a language takes a lot of time.","Learning a language takes motivation.","Teaching a language takes self-discipline."]},"answer":"Learning a language takes self-discipline.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-self-discipline"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Stop","procrastinating","and","start","your","homework"],"translation":"Pare de procrastinar e comece a lição de casa."},"answer":"Stop procrastinating and start your homework.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-procrastinate"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l04-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l04","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why are you studying on a Saturday? (você faltou às aulas e precisa pôr a matéria em dia)","translation":"Por que você está estudando num sábado?"},"answer":"I misse