"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"O que a orientadora oferece ao Ivan?","options":["Uma bolsa para estudantes que trabalham, que paga a mensalidade","Um emprego na universidade","Mais tempo para a prova","Mudá-lo de curso"]},"answer":"Uma bolsa para estudantes que trabalham, que paga a mensalidade","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A orientadora pergunta sobre “our scholarship for working students” e explica: “It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l05-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Um estudante conversa com uma orientadora da universidade.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"O que Ivan teria feito diferente se soubesse antes da bolsa?","options":["Não teria pegado tantos turnos de trabalho","Não teria se matriculado","Teria mudado de emprego","Teria largado a faculdade antes"]},"answer":"Não teria pegado tantos turnos de trabalho","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ivan diz: “If I’d known about it earlier, I wouldn’t have taken so many shifts”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u09-l05-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u09-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre parar de procrastinar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"O que o autor recomenda a quem nunca experimentou o método dele?","options":["Que experimente, mesmo que no começo pareça estranho","Que não tente","Que peça ajuda a um especialista","Que estude mais horas seguidas"]},"answer":"Que experimente, mesmo que no começo pareça estranho","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ele escreve: “If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"