ed_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-burst-into-tears"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-l03-e04","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-l03","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Um avô conta para a neta como conheceu a avó dela.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"Como a avó se aproximou do avô?","options":["Do nada, ela foi até ele e o chamou para dançar","Ele a chamou para dançar","Um amigo os apresentou","Eles se conheceram na rua"]},"answer":"Do nada, ela foi até ele e o chamou para dançar","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O avô diz: “Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-l03-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-l03","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Um avô conta para a neta como conheceu a avó dela.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"O que quebrou o gelo naquela noite?","options":["Ela riu quando ele pisou no pé dela","Uma piada do avô","Uma música","Eles eram vizinhos"]},"answer":"Ela riu quando ele pisou no pé dela","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O avô diz: “She laughed, and that broke the ice”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-l03-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-l03","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u11-grandpa","setting":"Um avô conta para a neta como conheceu a avó dela.","speakers":[{"name":"Lily","voice":"a"},{"name":"Grandpa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Grandpa, how did you meet Grandma?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"At a wedding. I didn't know anyone, so I was standing in a corner, feeling a bit silly."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"And then?"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Then, out of the blue, she came over and asked me to dance. I was so nervous that I stepped on her foot!"},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"Oh no!"},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"She laughed, and that broke the ice. We talked all night. It turned out that we lived on the same street."},{"speaker":"Lily","text":"That's so romantic."},{"speaker":"Grandpa","text":"Fifty years later, I still remember it. When we got married, her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!"}]},"question":"O que aconteceu com a mãe da avó no casamento?","options":["Ela caiu no choro, de felicidade, segundo o avô","Ela foi embora cedo","Ela não quis ir","Riu muito"]},"answer":"Ela caiu no choro, de felicidade, segundo o avô","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O avô diz: “her mother burst into tears. Happy tears, I hope!”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-l03-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-l03","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"My old friend called me out of the blue.","options":["My old friend called me out of the blue.","My old friend called me on my birthday.","My best friend called me out of the blue.","My old friend visited me out of the blue."]},"answer":"My old friend called me out of the blue.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-out-of-the-blue"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-l03-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-l03","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["A","good","joke","can","break","the","ice"],"translation":"Uma boa piada pode quebrar o gelo."},"answer":"A good joke can break the ice.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-break-the-ice"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-l03-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-l03","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"How did she react to the news? (ela caiu no choro)","translation":"Como ela reagiu à notícia?"},"answer":"She burst into tears.","accepted_answers":["She burs