early.","We set off early in the morning!","Early in the morning."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-set-off"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u11-final-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u11-final","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Meu velho amigo me ligou do nada."},"answer":"My old friend called me out of the blue.","accepted_answers":["An old friend called me out of the blue.","My old friend phoned me out of the blue."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-out-of-the-blue"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e01","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Una cada palavra ao seu significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"dilemma","right":"dilema"},{"left":"weigh up","right":"pesar / avaliar"},{"left":"pros and cons","right":"prós e contras"},{"left":"trade-off","right":"concessão / o preço a pagar"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-dilemma","ept-weigh-up","ept-pros-and-cons","ept-trade-off"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e02","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I am weighing ___ the pros and cons.","translation":"Estou pesando os prós e os contras.","options":["up","out","down","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-weigh-up"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e03","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"More money, less free time: that is the ___.","translation":"Mais dinheiro, menos tempo livre: esse é o preço a pagar.","options":["trade-off","dilemma","problem","decision"]},"answer":"trade-off","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-trade-off"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e04","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-job-offer","setting":"Uma amiga conta para outra que tem que decidir se muda de cidade por causa do trabalho.","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"Qual é o dilema da Alice?","options":["Se aceita um cargo em Lisboa e se muda em um mês","Se muda de carreira","Se se muda para Berlim","Se larga o emprego para cuidar dos pais"]},"answer":"Se aceita um cargo em Lisboa e se muda em um mês","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A Alice diz: “I’ve got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager… I’d have to move in a month”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-guide","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo sobre como tomar decisões importantes.","title":"How to make a big decision","lines":["Big decisions are hard because there is always a trade-off: more money but less free time, adventure but less security.","First, write down the pros and cons. Seeing them on paper helps you weigh them up more calmly.","Second, ask yourself what is really at stake. Will this matter in five years? If not, do not spend weeks on it.","Third, listen to your gut feeling. Research suggests that our first reaction often contains information we are not aware of.","Finally, accept that no decision is perfect. If we had a crystal ball, we would never make mistakes. We do not, so we learn from them."]},"question":"Segundo o artigo, por que as grandes decisões são difíceis?","options":["Porque sempre se ganha algo em troca de perder outra coisa","Porque nunca há informação","Porque as pessoas são inseguras","Porque levam muito tempo"]},"answer":"Porque sempre se ganha algo em troca de perder outra coisa","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “there is always a trade-off: more money but less free time, adventure but less security”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-guide","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo sobre como tomar decisões importantes.","title":"How to make a big decision","lines":["Big decisions are hard because there is always a trade-off: more money but less free time, adventure but less security.","First, write down the pros and cons. Seeing them on paper helps you weigh them up more calmly.","Second, ask yourself what is really at stake. Will this matter in five years? If not, do not spend weeks on it.","Third, listen to your gut feeling. Research suggests that our first reaction often contains information we are not aware of.","Finally, accept that no decision is perfect. If we had a crystal ball, we would never make mistakes. We do not, so we learn from them."]},"question":"Para que serve anotar os prós e os contras, segundo o artigo?","options":["Para pesá-los com mais calma","Para mostrá-los aos outros","Para não ter que decidir","Para lembrar deles anos depois"]},"answer":"Para pesá-los com mais calma","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “Seeing them on paper helps you weigh them up more calmly”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"I've got a real dilemma.","options":["I've got a real dilemma.","I've got a real problem.","I haven't got a real dilemma.","We've got a real dilemma."]},"answer":"I've got a real dilemma.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-dilemma"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Write","down","the","pros","and","cons"],"translation":"Anote os prós e os contras."},"answer":"Write down the pros and cons.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["ept-pros-and-cons"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Have you decided about the new job? (não, você ainda está pesando os prós e os contras)","translation":"Você já decidiu sobre o emprego novo?"},"answer":"No, I'm still weighing up the pros and cons.","accepted_answers":["No, I am still weighing up the pros and cons.","I'm still weighing up the pros and cons.","Not yet. I'm still weighing up the pros and cons."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-weigh-up","ept-pros-and-cons"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l01-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l01","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Eu tenho um verdadeiro dilema."},"answer":"I've got a real dilemma.","accepted_answers":["I have got a real dilemma.","I have a real dilemma.","I've got a big dilemma."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-dilemma"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l02-e01","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l02","position":1,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I had taken the job, I would ___ in Berlin now.","translation":"Se eu tivesse aceitado o emprego, agora estaria em Berlim.","options":["be","have been","been","being"]},"answer":"be","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mista: passado diferente (had taken) → resultado no presente (would be… now).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-would-have"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l02-e02","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l02","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I ___ braver, I would have said yes.","translation":"Se eu fosse mais corajosa, teria dito que sim.","options":["were","am","would be","will be"]},"answer":"were","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mista: presente diferente (if I were) → resultado no passado (would have said).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-would-have"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l02-e03","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l02","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","promp