 “If you had taken it, you’d be speaking German by now” (passado diferente → presente diferente).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l02-e05","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-job-offer","setting":"Uma amiga conta para outra que tem que decidir se muda de cidade por causa do trabalho.","speakers":[{"name":"Alice","voice":"a"},{"name":"Rosa","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"O que a intuição diz à Alice e por que ela está em dúvida?","options":["Que vá, mas ela está em dúvida por causa dos pais, que estão ficando mais velhos","Que fique, porque ela não gosta de Lisboa","Que vá, porque o salário é alto","Ela não tem nenhuma intuição"]},"answer":"Que vá, mas ela está em dúvida por causa dos pais, que estão ficando mais velhos","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A Alice diz: “To go. But I’m having second thoughts because of my parents. They’re getting older”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id"