,"lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Um anúncio de um serviço de mediação entre vizinhos.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"Que duas vantagens do serviço o anúncio destaca?","options":["Que é gratuito e confidencial","Que é rápido e barato","Que é obrigatório e gratuito","Que funciona nos fins de semana"]},"answer":"Que é gratuito e confidencial","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O anúncio diz: “Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l05-e06","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Um anúncio de um serviço de mediação entre vizinhos.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"O que o serviço promete sobre as suas informações?","options":["Que nunca vai compartilhá-las com a outra pessoa sem a sua permissão","Que as publica no centro comunitário","Que as compartilha com a polícia","Que as apaga depois de uma semana"]},"answer":"Que nunca vai compartilhá-las com a outra pessoa sem a sua permissão","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O anúncio diz: “Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l05-e07","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l05","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Uma reunião tensa de uma equipe antes de apresentar um projeto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"O que a gerente quer dizer com “Only then can we finish on time”?","options":["Que só com esse acordo eles vão conseguir terminar a tempo","Que vão terminar tarde de qualquer jeito","Que o cliente decide a data","Que é preciso começar de novo"]},"answer":"Que só com esse acordo eles vão conseguir terminar a tempo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Only then + auxiliar + sujeito: só se fizerem o que ela propôs vão conseguir terminar a tempo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l05-e08","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l05","position":8,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Only then can we finish on time.","options":["Only then can we finish on time.","Only then can we start on time.","Only then we can finish on time.","Even then we can finish on time."]},"answer":"Only then can we finish on time.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["ept-only-then"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l05-e09","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l05","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responda em inglês","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"If you have any questions, contact us. (reescreva começando com Should you…)","translation":"Se tiver alguma dúvida, entre em contato conosco."},"answer":"Should you have any questions, contact us.","accepted_answers":["Should you have any questions, please contact us.","Should you have questions, contact us."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["ept-should-you"]},{"id":"ept-b2-u12-l05-e10","lesson_id":"ept-b2-u12-l05","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduza para o inglês","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Sob nenhuma circunstância você deve abrir esta porta."},"answer":"Under no circumstances should you open this door.","accepted_answers":["Under no circumstances should you open that door.","Under no circumstances must you open this doo