":"Nina","text":"Can I ask you something? Did my email this morning seem rude to you?"},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Honestly? It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding. I'll call him and explain."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Good idea. A call is better than another email. Tone doesn't always get across in writing."}]},"question":"Por que o e-mail da Nina pareceu grosseiro?","options":["Porque era muito curto, sem cumprimento nem agradecimento","Porque tinha erros","Porque ela mandou para todo mundo","Porque estava em letras maiúsculas"]},"answer":"Porque era muito curto, sem cumprimento nem agradecimento","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sam diz: “It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.0iadlp4y53g98l","content_hash":"v1:6470d81a3c346d390f8fa2e8153301d2596ba289c96ec235f39bbfa4b353002e","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u1-email-tone","setting":"Dois colegas de trabalho falam sobre um e-mail que pegou mal.","speakers":[{"name":"Nina","voice":"a"},{"name":"Sam","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Can I ask you something? Did my email this morning seem rude to you?"},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"Honestly? It was a bit short. You just wrote \"Fix this today.\" No hello, no thanks."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"Oh no. I didn't mean to sound angry. I was in a hurry, that's all."},{"speaker":"Sam","text":"I know, but Mark actually thought you were annoyed with him."},{"speaker":"Nina","text":"That's a misunderstanding.