ost","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como dar uma opinião difícil.","title":"How to say difficult things","lines":["Most of us tend to avoid difficult conversations. We are afraid of hurting people, so we say nothing, or we drop a hint and hope the other person understands.","The problem is that hints are easy to miss. Your colleague may not realize there is a problem at all.","Being straightforward does not mean being blunt. Start with something positive, then point out the problem clearly and calmly, and finally look for a solution together.","Remember: people can accept honest feedback when it is tactful. What they find hard to accept is sarcasm."]},"question":"Segundo o texto, qual é o problema das indiretas?","options":["Que é fácil não perceber","Que são grosseiras","Que levam muito tempo","Que sempre ofendem"]},"answer":"Que é fácil não perceber","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O texto diz: “The problem is that hints are easy to miss”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.kpi3vgbzidaqf5","content_hash":"v1:b88f20e34e7d124c6cf490ba3e33ce5afa72f8123791e4a378af885d00728795","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u1-feedback-post","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre como dar uma opinião difícil.","title":"How to say difficult things","lines":["Most of us tend to avoid difficult conversations. We are afraid of hurting people, so we say nothing, or we drop a hint and hope the other person understands.","The problem is that hints are easy to miss. Your colleague may not realize there is a problem at all.","Being straightforward does not mean being blunt. Start with something positive, then point out the problem clearly and calmly, and finally look for a solution together.","Remember: people can accept honest feedback when it is tactf