mplained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"Segundo a socióloga, o que cada geração diz da seguinte?","options":["Que ela não respeita os costumes de antes","Que ela é mais trabalhadora","Que ela vive melhor","Que ela é mais feliz"]},"answer":"Que ela não respeita os costumes de antes","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O apresentador pergunta se os jovens não respeitam os costumes, e ela responde: “Every generation has said that about the next one”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.yam39vz9h0vqvo","content_hash":"v1:e7f06190c77e6b08c174a360e71c6d1609b2cf96b70693c61ab5826336c4bb3c","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u3-podcast","setting":"Um podcast entrevista uma socióloga sobre as gerações.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Dr. Reyes","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"People often complain that young people have no respect for old customs. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Every generation has said that about the next one. It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"O que mudou e o que não mudou, segundo a socióloga?","options":["Mudaram os costumes, mas não os valores","Mudaram os valores, mas não os costumes","Nada mudou","Tudo mudou"]},"answer":"Mudaram os costumes, mas não os valores","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ela diz: “Customs change, of course… But the values behind them haven’t disappeared”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.85vphaoxlqbol7","content_hash":"v1:4f910f0ca79fa62763d59581fc6071937b7e26842d1abf53d2eb6fa8b347b070","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Technology has changed our society.","options":["Technology has changed our society.","Technology will change our society.","Technology has changed our generation.","The internet has changed our society."]},"answer":"Technology has changed our society.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.b0ys5qep54w4c5","content_hash":"v1:626d694797565096370d1683e634b251e3f538a87afca24b48bf4b83387276a3","prompt_es":"Ordene as palavras","payload":{"type":"orde