 customs. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Every generation has said that about the next one. It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"Por que a socióloga menciona os gregos antigos?","options":["Para mostrar que a reclamação sobre os jovens é muito antiga","Para falar da história da Grécia","Para dizer que os gregos eram melhores","Para explicar um costume grego"]},"answer":"Para mostrar que a reclamação sobre os jovens é muito antiga","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ela diz: “It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.yarezl2f2maix8","content_hash":"v1:26a34093c59465fccb0315bfd5f66698e5c9d718179a4ec464bdf0d98615abd9","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u3-podcast","setting":"Um podcast entrevista uma socióloga sobre as gerações.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Dr. Reyes","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"People often complain that young people have no respect for old customs. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Every generation has said that about the next one. It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"O que a socióloga acha da ideia de que a distância entre as gerações está cada vez maior?","options":["Que muita gente acredita nisso, mas a pesquisa dela não confirma","Que é verdade","Que é uma ideia nova","Que ninguém acredita nisso"]},"answer":"Que muita gente acredita nisso, mas a pesquisa dela não confirma","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ela diz: “Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.p1qcmrlukegl8o","content_hash":"v1:9de29def128ba8d84f90ba607b1e31f10da967c046610352efd29c5ef8e0fcbc","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u3-market","document":"notice","setting":"Um aviso da prefeitura sobre o mercado antigo.","title":"Our market is changing","lines":["The old market is being renovated and will be closed until the end of May.","The roof has already been repaired, and new lights are being installed this month.","The market has been u