antly told to reduce our carbon footprint: take shorter showers, eat less meat, fly less. These things matter, but they are not enough.","Just one hundred companies are responsible for most of the world’s emissions. Whereas a single family can save a few tons of CO2 a year, one large factory can produce millions.","This does not mean that individual action is useless. Even if your own impact is small, your choices send a message to companies and governments.","The real solution is a fast move to renewable energy, such as solar and wind. Only governments can make that happen, and only if we vote for it."]},"question":"Qual é a verdadeira solução, segundo o autor?","options":["Passar rápido para a energia renovável, algo que só os governos podem fazer","Que cada família tome banhos curtos","Fechar todas as fábricas","Parar de votar"]},"answer":"Passar rápido para a energia renovável, algo que só os governos podem fazer","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “The real solution is a fast move to renewable energy… Only governments can make that happen”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.ifn6zpm0y2po12","content_hash":"v1:e748bc19fb834278ea2c8ac2cde8a87be066eeb4068c7fffa05bf78b8af251e9","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u7-students","setting":"Dois estudantes discutem se uma pessoa pode ajudar o planeta.","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"That's great, but honestly, it won't change anything. Even if everyone in this city stopped flying, it would be a tiny difference."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I don't agree. Big changes always start with small groups of people."},{"speake