 after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"Segundo o autor, o que o ajudou a parar de procrastinar?","options":["A autodisciplina: uma rotina que funciona até nos dias ruins","A motivação","Um professor particular","Desligar o celular"]},"answer":"A autodisciplina: uma rotina que funciona até nos dias ruins","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ele escreve: “What finally helped was not motivation… What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.evzwh2jnpfppzf","content_hash":"v1:2f6a9eb650d12032b161eb605935398d2f67fe714068fb3fe1d175f1b1be3559","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-procrastinate","document":"post","setting":"Um post de blog sobre parar de procrastinar.","title":"How I stopped putting things off","lines":["For years I was an expert at procrastinating. I cleaned my room, checked my phone, made coffee… anything except studying.","What finally helped was not motivation. Motivation comes and goes. What I needed was self-discipline: a routine that works even on bad days.","Now I study for twenty-five minutes, then take a five-minute break. I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying.","If you have never tried it, give it a try. It feels strange at first, a bit outside your comfort zone, but after two weeks it becomes a habit."]},"question":"O que ele faz com cada sessão de estudo?","options":["Anota num caderno e gosta de ver a lista crescer","Grava em vídeo","Compartilha nas redes sociais","Mostra para um amigo"]},"answer":"Anota num caderno e gosta de ver a lista crescer","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Ele escreve: “I keep track of every session in a notebook, and seeing the list grow is surprisingly satisfying”.","difficul