,"voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. Before you decide, have you heard about our scholarship for working students?"},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"No. What does it involve?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours. You'd have time to catch up with the classes you've missed."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"That would change everything. If I'd known about it earlier, I wouldn't have taken so many shifts."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Well, you know now. Applications close on Friday. I can help you with the form."},{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"Thank you. I really thought I had no choice."}]},"question":"O que a orientadora oferece ao Ivan?","options":["Uma bolsa para estudantes que trabalham, que paga a mensalidade","Um emprego na universidade","Mais tempo para a prova","Mudá-lo de curso"]},"answer":"Uma bolsa para estudantes que trabalham, que paga a mensalidade","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A orientadora pergunta sobre “our scholarship for working students” e explica: “It pays your fees, so you could work fewer hours”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.j5l36m53yktn83","content_hash":"v1:edfb06bec0df361b4fc7f1ee22c9036475b7ad24f4ddea9db92edc65ff1f2d63","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u9-advisor","setting":"Um estudante conversa com uma orientadora da universidade.","speakers":[{"name":"Ivan","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Ortiz","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ivan","text":"I'm thinking of dropping out. I've missed six weeks of classes because of my job, and I'll never catch up."},{"speaker":"Ms. Ortiz","text":"Wait. 