:"Choveu a semana toda. Como resultado, o jogo foi cancelado.","options":["result","reason","end","point"]},"answer":"result","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.k1uo8xian06w86","content_hash":"v1:21d2153c42c3246222b998dacf8fb7589f76130f1eab8133d766d22ad54198a4","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u10-school-debate","setting":"Um debate em uma escola: os celulares devem ser proibidos na sala de aula?","speakers":[{"name":"Moderator","voice":"a"},{"name":"Lucas","voice":"b"},{"name":"Hannah","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Today's debate: should phones be banned in schools? Lucas, you're first."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"Yes, they should. Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school. As a result, many students feel anxious all day."},{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Hannah, your answer?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Admittedly, phones can be a distraction. Nevertheless, banning them is not the answer. On the contrary, schools should teach students how to use them responsibly."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"But that's an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"Que razões o Lucas dá para proibir os celulares?","options":["Eles distraem e facilitam o bullying, que continua depois da escola","São caros","Quebram com facilidade","Os professores não sabem usá-los"]},"answer":"Eles distraem e facilitam o bullying, que continua depois da escola","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O Lucas diz: “Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.ksw5ymmwqdwsz5","content_hash":"v1:8d1b740ce47a1262066894be37b4c456796c1cd23aba11369bec3a06e5dcf5a5","prompt_es":"Ouça e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"ept.stim.b2-u10-school-debate","setting":"Um debate em uma escola: os celulares devem ser proibidos na sala de aula?","speakers":[{"name":"Moderator","voice":"a"},{"name":"Lucas","voice":"b"},{"name":"Hannah","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Today's debate: should phones be banned in schools? Lucas, you're first."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"Yes, they should. Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school. As a result, many students feel anxious all day."},{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Hannah, your answer?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Admittedly, phones can be a distraction. Nevertheless, banning them is not the answer. On the contrary, schools should teach students how to use them responsibly."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"But that's an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"Que consequência o Lucas menciona?","options":["Muitos alunos ficam ansiosos o dia todo","Os alunos tiram notas ruins","Os pais reclamam","A escola gasta mais"]},"answer":"Muitos alunos ficam ansiosos o dia todo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O Lucas diz: “As a result, many students feel anxious all day”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.4iq4n0iur5pq8s","content_hash":"v1:02da4896c41a3093327975d65048e5e67423e63025930f803cab945ef4583a6f","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo de opinião sobre a universidade gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"Que segundo argumento a autora acrescenta com furthermore?","options":["Que a educação gratuita dá aos alunos pobres as mesmas oportunidades","Que os formados pagam menos impostos","Que as universidades são baratas","Que os ricos não deveriam estudar"]},"answer":"Que a educação gratuita dá aos alunos pobres as mesmas oportunidades","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"O artigo diz: “Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.x23pmkqnex7jub","content_hash":"v1:014a5272759adfda52ef7e7651c8edd3dc9f9bc560b3dc024aaa6e7a5e46c455","prompt_es":"Ouça e escolha o que você ouve","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We had a debate about social media.","options":["We had a debate about social media.","We had a debate about the news.","We have a debate about social media.","They had a debate about social media."]},"answer":"We had a debate about social m