 is cheap. Moreover, it's easy to start.","The plan is cheap. Furthermore, it is easy to start.","The plan is cheap. Moreover it is easy to start."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.29zeol1j1w25wt","content_hash":"v1:776c722638cd52d4b11cf8dae5381abe362e2a5caff911da39bbe19632bf831d","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"___ matters is that you tried.","translation":"O que importa é que você tentou.","options":["What","That","Which","It"]},"answer":"What","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"What… is: “o que… é”. Não se diz “That matters is”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.h0vr368wo9gf8l","content_hash":"v1:122b8993e7f3d0572f537f50c1d62b93ea0b8636280862f84cce990c00cd4f5e","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The reason ___ I called is that I need your help.","translation":"O motivo pelo qual eu liguei é que preciso da sua ajuda.","options":["why","because","what","for"]},"answer":"why","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The reason why… is that… (não “is because” em um registro cuidado).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.2y5lmarmd6xwot","content_hash":"v1:9b60765579acb5d65148ff7643642d1b664b88403b83dbddcfd02d59e4f068dc","prompt_es":"Complete a frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"He was late again. In other ___, he does not care.","translation":"Ele chegou atrasado de novo. Em outras palavras, ele não se importa.","options":["words","ways","reasons","times"]},"answer":"words","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficu