","text":"I've got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"That's amazing! So why do you look worried?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"Because I'd have to move in a month. I've been weighing up the pros and cons all week."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"What does your gut feeling say?"},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"To go. But I'm having second thoughts because of my parents. They're getting older."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Remember two years ago, when you turned down the job in Berlin? If you had taken it, you'd be speaking German by now."},{"speaker":"Alice","text":"I know. And if I were braver, I would have said yes immediately this time too."},{"speaker":"Rosa","text":"Every choice has a trade-off. But Lisbon is only a short flight away. You could visit them often."}]},"question":"Qual é o dilema da Alice?","options":["Se aceita um cargo em Lisboa e se muda em um mês","Se muda de carreira","Se se muda para Berlim","Se larga o emprego para cuidar dos pais"]},"answer":"Se aceita um cargo em Lisboa e se muda em um mês","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A Alice diz: “I’ve got a real dilemma. The Lisbon office has offered me a job as team manager… I’d have to move in a month”.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"ept.ex.nvc3q0m9xqqtb3","content_hash":"v1:e0dc30659a7616750a9d89850be513c414cbf342ab0a99922bf40e580b7358fe","prompt_es":"Leia e responda","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"ept.stim.b2-u12-guide","document":"post","setting":"Um artigo sobre como tomar decisões importantes.","title":"How to make a big decision","lines":["Big decisions are hard because there is always a trade-off: more money but less free time, adventure but less security.","First, write down the pros and cons. Seeing them on paper helps you weigh them up more calmly.","Second, ask yoursel